ized throughout  this game  this is in two ways firstly the meta  weapons usually require egregious  unlocks  so for example the bruin lmg which is  the main choice of weapon right now  requires the player to eliminate three  players near smoke in one match  tough but not impossible right well this  must be done  15 times free-to-play players are at a  serious disadvantage  from those who own the game who can do  this in many other different modes  and to double down on this point if you  don't want to waste your time unlocking  the weapon to be  even on the battlefield you can pay for  it instead  it's it's very predatory but the game is  also very very good  and with game modes utilizing up to 200  players there is action constantly  i want to dislike this game but i can't  it's so good so grab a squad for this  one this is going to be here for years  to come  you either pay your way to stay equal or  you grind it out  that looks like that's the way it's  going to be the next game is rocket  league  so first let me state as i'm writing  this it is not available yet  but it is planned to drop any day  potentially without notice  over the summer months so instead of  waiting six months for the next episode  i'm going to bring it to your attention  now keep an eye on this one rocket  league is going free  it's been a paid experience for five  years the football car racing arcade  extravaganza  it was groundbreaking in its day and the  competitive scene surrounding the game  grew massively but now it's time to go  free to play  and you've likely already got this game  so here's something for you  you get more free stuff on the day the  game switches to free to play  more than 200 legacy items will be  available to you  the golden cosmos boost the day chiaro  wheels and the huntress player banner  it's pretty cool when a game switches to  free to play they still reward those who  have been there from the start  i like this anyway once i know exactly  when rocket league